{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> calls this gloomy mood of mine April sickness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this season when the cherry blossoms bloom, I sink into a funk, like someone with the May blues.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't really understand the reason, but it seems my constitution can't tolerate cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, for me, early April is nothing but days of pain.</STYLE>
